<Legal
  title="Cookie Notice | Zelux"
  description="Zelux uses no advertising or cross-site tracking cookies. Here's exactly what storage the site and the Cal.com booking calendar may use."
  heading="Cookie notice"
  updated="25 November 2026"
>
  <p><strong>Short version: this site uses no advertising cookies and no cross-site tracking.</strong> That's why there's no cookie banner.</p>

  <h2>This website</h2>
  <p>zelux.co.uk doesn't set cookies of its own. If page-view analytics are switched on, they use Vercel Web Analytics in cookieless mode, which counts visits in aggregate without storing anything on your device or identifying you.</p>

  <h2>The booking calendar</h2>
  <p>The booking page embeds a calendar from <strong>Cal.com</strong>. When it loads, Cal.com may use strictly necessary cookies or local storage to show available times and complete your booking. These are needed for the booking to work, so they don't require consent under the Privacy and Electronic Communications Regulations (PECR). Cal.com's own policy applies to that embed.</p>
  <p>If you'd rather not load the calendar, email <a href="mailto:kaden@zelux.co.uk">kaden@zelux.co.uk</a> and we'll find a time by email.</p>

  <h2>Managing cookies</h2>
  <p>You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings at any time. Blocking them won't affect the rest of this site.</p>

  <h2>Questions</h2>
  <p>Email <a href="mailto:kaden@zelux.co.uk">kaden@zelux.co.uk</a>. See also the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.</p>
</Legal>
